{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>A guilt offering, a guilt offering.</b> Rashi, of blessed memory, explains: to include the guilt offering for a betrothed maidservant, which is a ram in its second year. And it is puzzling, for certainly every ram mentioned in the Torah is in its second year. Rather, say: to include the guilt offering for a betrothed maidservant, which is a guilt offering valued in silver shekels — and so it is stated in the Sifra."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:50.659322184Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}